  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GZ-Village and Neighborhood Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The Project Development Objective is: within a fragile context, to promote a coordinated development approach which builds the capacity of communities to plan for and manage development resources.  The key indicators for project success include:    a)	percentage of activities identified through the Area Development Plans that receive funding from other sources;  b)	percentage of projects with economically and/or socially marginalized groups as main beneficiaries.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
